# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets — never commit these. The Supabase service-role key bypasses every
# row-level-security policy in the portal database; it belongs in Vercel's
# environment variables and nowhere else.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Source video, kept out on purpose.
#
# These are the ~110MB of raw generation output the scroll sequences were made
# FROM. The frames they produced are committed under web/public/, which is what
# the site actually serves, so nothing here is needed to build or deploy — and
# Vercel re-clones the repo on every build, so carrying them would slow every
# deploy for no gain.
#
# They still live in this folder on the working machine. If they should be
# backed up, SharePoint is the right home for video; if they must be versioned,
# use Git LFS rather than committing them directly.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local QA artefacts
.qa/
shots/
